[[Image:BlacksmithT.png|left]]''<font style="font-size:15px">{{Quote|Blacksmiths use metal ore and other natural materials to create ingenious tools and dangerous weapons. You can craft [[Items|items]] for your own jobs or sell them to other players to earn [[Coins|coins]]. Work with other professions to help you harvest the raw materials you need to craft additional items. Smitty in [[Snowhill]] can teach the tricks of the trade.|Job description}}</font>''
'''''Blacksmith''''' is a [[Membership|Members]]-only crafting [[Jobs|job]], specializing in the creation of weapons. A crafting class job, experience is gained by completing Blacksmith quests and by playing the forge [[Mini-Games|minigames]].

==Unlocking Blacksmith==
Blacksmith can be unlocked by speaking with Smitty in [[Snowhill]].

==Trainers==
*Steelbloom in [[Sanctuary]]
*Smitty in Snowhill
